  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "BE32B2458977D5E2",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n歡迎光臨玻瓶道館。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "BE32B3458977D795",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要挑戰驚濤海味料理人……\\n道館館主海岱嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "BE32B0458977D27C",
      "text": "那麼，請讓我帶[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳前往對戰場。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "BE32B1458977D42F",
      "text": "等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好後，\\n請隨時告訴我一聲。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_boy_entry_01",
      "hash64": "A66AD42AF62B610B",
      "text": "海岱大叔，\\n陪我玩，陪我玩～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_woman_entry_01",
      "hash64": "3EB8108C114F97B3",
      "text": "也請你來嚐嚐\\n我們店的新菜單吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_01",
      "hash64": "9DC5825CD21ED7A0",
      "text": "抱歉啊，大家！\\n我接下來得幹些道館的活兒！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_entry_02",
      "hash64": "9DC5855CD21EDCB9",
      "text": "對手正等著我呢。\\n今天就請大家先回去吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_girl_entry_01",
      "hash64": "43B5DA4BCCC05C43",
      "text": "好～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "5DF008B7D2FAC2E1",
      "text": "是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳啊！\\n嘿！吃飽了沒啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "5DF005B7D2FABDC8",
      "text": "在漬沁鎮[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳可是\\n幫了我一個大忙啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "5DF006B7D2FABF7B",
      "text": "託[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的福，我好像能\\n做出究極的海帶料理囉！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "5DF00BB7D2FAC7FA",
      "text": "不過，在對戰場上\\n我是不會手下留情的啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "5DF00CB7D2FAC9AD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 28]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "5DF009B7D2FAC494",
      "text": "討價還價，市場要比價，\\n出招接招，道館要過招。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "5DF00AB7D2FAC647",
      "text": "場上海上，都得鬥智鬥力，\\n出招出海，都是漩渦四伏！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "5DEFFFB7D2FAB396",
      "text": "水屬性寶可夢的海味宴席！\\n來！這就來飽嚐一頓吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "5DF000B7D2FAB549",
      "text": "哇、哈、哈！輸得真是舒爽！\\n就像是來到了清晨的市場啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "5DF38DB7D2FDDAB7",
      "text": "對[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳來說，\\n我簡直就是砧板上的鯉魚王！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "5DF38CB7D2FDD904",
      "text": "拋網精準，收網俐落！\\n大豐收啊！大豐收！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "5DF38FB7D2FDDE1D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不畏競爭地釣起了勝利！\\n實在佩服！佩服！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "5DF38EB7D2FDDC6A",
      "text": "讓我們將[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳獲得\\n道館徽章的這個瞬間！\\c\\n用我一直想擺擺看的超～潮姿勢\\n拍成難忘的紀念照吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_badge",
      "hash64": "49E5EBF085F3C8A5",
      "text": "只要有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]個道館徽章，\\n等級[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的寶可夢就會\\r\\n比較容易捉到，而且也會聽話！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_badge_all",
      "hash64": "D1F9A566E5D769DD",
      "text": "只要有８個道館徽章，\\n不論什麼寶可夢都能捉到，\\r\\n也都會聽[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_waza",
      "hash64": "3DC23664F56B2577",
      "text": "若是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，一定能得心應手地用這個招式！\\n來！跳樓大拍賣囉！把這也拿去吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_14",
      "hash64": "5DF389B7D2FDD3EB",
      "text": "好啦，我差不多該去備料\\n準備開店了！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_mizu_15",
      "hash64": "5DF388B7D2FDD238",
      "text": "我期待[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳再次光臨啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_mizu_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "BE32AE458977CF16",
      "text": "恭喜！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在玻瓶道館及格了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
